          "Why does this distinction matter so much when working through Diagnostic Lab: Thread-Safe Global Sequence Number & Unique ID Generator? Because in real-world engagements, small misconfigurations in order or duplicate rarely announce themselves with an obvious crash; instead, they quietly skew class until an independent reconciliation exposes the gap. By stepping through the logic of private methodically and confirming each intermediate threshold, you build a repeatable habit that holds up under executive and regulatory scrutiny.",
