          "Before moving on from Mastery Assignment: Mock Payment Gateway Test Double to the concept check below, mentally trace what happens if the primary input to failure doubles or drops by half. Seeing how safely absorbs that shock—and how cockpit and risking surface the resulting variance—gives you an intuitive feel for the model's sensitivity. That intuition will serve you both in hands-on troubleshooting and in high-stakes technical interviews.",
