          "Let us connect Detective Lab: Contended Synchronized Bottleneck vs LongAdder Striping directly to day-to-day practice: Like a bank with a single customer line leading to one teller (AtomicLong) versus a bank with 16 parallel teller windows (LongAdder). Even t, the most important discipline is verifying the underlying assumptions before acting on the headline figure. LongAdder distributes writes across striped cells hashed by thread ID, avoiding the cache-line invalidation storms of single-address CAS, which is why experienced practitioners always document both the primary calculation and the boundary conditions surrounding single and parallel.",
